        "name": "How is raised intracranial pressure managed in acute liver failure?",
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "NAC improves transplant-free survival in early (grade I–II encephalopathy) non-paracetamol ALF (Lee et al., Gastroenterology 2009); start at the same 21-hour regimen as for paracetamol.",
        },
        "name": "When is N-acetylcysteine indicated in non-paracetamol ALF?",
      },
    ],
