        "name": "How should family meetings be structured in ICU?",
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Advance decisions to refuse treatment (ADRT, valid and applicable under MCA 2005) and lasting power of attorney bind treatment decisions; ReSPECT forms guide but do not bind; always seek patient or representative input before withdrawal.",
